{
  "description": [
    "Cases of the breakdown eligibility of a stored widget, run through the two copies of the rule: the editor and the",
    "dashboards (canWidgetBreakDown and getBreakdownEntityTypes in opencti-front/src/utils/widget/widgetBreakdown.ts) and",
    "the public dashboards (the same functions in opencti-graphql/src/modules/publicDashboard/publicDashboard-breakdown.ts).",
    "canBreakDown: whether the widget can be broken down. entityTypes: the types its first dataset is restricted to, read",
    "on the type filter key of the perspective of the widget (entity_type, relationship_type); none for the audits, whose",
    "logs have no public breakdown: the public dashboards do not read them."
  ],
